l in Settings)\",\n        \"body\": \"COLLABORATORS section: add helper names (e.g. Sara, Paolo). Wages and other details can be added later.\"\n      },\n      \"spese_fisse_setup\": {\n        \"title\": \"Fixed expenses (still in Settings)\",\n        \"body\": \"Scroll to ANNUAL EXPENSES: add van insurance, social security, accountant, etc. ⚠️ NOTE: the PITCH FEE goes inside the matching market card (NOT in Agenda — you're always inside Settings, in each market's panel).\"\n      },\n      \"home_calendar\": {\n        \"title\": \"You're on HOME! 🏠\",\n        \"body\": \"This is your daily working screen. At the top you see the date: use ◀ ▶ arrows to change day, or tap the date for the full calendar.\"\n      },\n      \"home_lordo\": {\n        \"title\": \"Today's weather ☀️\",\n        \"body\": \"The app preselects the weather based on real forecasts. You can always change it manually by tapping the matching icon (sun, cloud, rain...).\"\n      },\n      \"home_incasso\": {\n        \"title\": \"How much did you earn today? 💰\",\n        \"body\": \"Enter the GROSS total, then enter ONLY ONE between: CASH amount or CARD amount. The app will calculate the rest automatically.\"\n      },\n      \"spese_extra_voci\": {\n        \"title\": \"Today's extra expenses 🛒\",\n        \"body\": \"Tap EXPENSES to add every cost of today. From suppliers (you'll see the names from Settings) to any free entry. Examples: coffee €3, breakfast €5, lunch €12, parking €4, tolls €8. For suppliers choose cash or invoice, and split the cost over multiple days if you want.\"\n      },\n      \"home_salva\": {\n        \"title\": \"Save the day 💾\",\n        \"body\": \"When ready, tap SAVE to archive the day. You'll find it in history, charts and statistics. ✏️ You can always go back with the calendar and edit a saved day's data.\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"title\": \"Your statistics 📊\",\n        \"body\": \"In Statistics you see gross/net charts, top markets, top suppliers, pie charts and many other useful insights.\"\n      },\n      \"buongiorno\": {\n        \"title\": \"The «Good Morning» AI 🤖\",\n        \"body\": \"Every morning open Good Morning to get the REAL WEATHER of the day and the GAS STATION with the BEST PRICE along your route to the market. Plus: upcoming deadlines, top markets and personalized tips based on YOUR data.\"\n      },\n      \"carburante_setup\": {\n        \"title\": \"Fuel consumption ⛽\",\n        \"body\": \"In Settings → FUEL enter NOW an example: last refuel (liters & euros). The app will use this to automatically calculate how much each market costs based on km driven.\"\n      },\n      \"notes_setup\": {\n        \"title\": \"NOTES section 📝\",\n        \"body\": \"Here you write appointments, orders to suppliers, deadlines, ideas. Add NOW an appointment (e.g. \\\"Accountant Tuesday 10:00\\\"). You'll find it both in the Home calendar and in the 🔔 notifications bell.\"\n      },\n      \"backup_info\": {\n        \"title\": \"Data backup 💾\",\n        \"body\": \"Always export a backup! Go to Settings → DATA BACKUP and tap EXPORT to save a file. Send it via WhatsApp, email or load it later if you change phone.\"\n      },\n      \"done\": {\n        \"title\": \"🎉 All set!\",\n        \"body\": \"You're ready to start! Remember: you can relaunch this guide anytime from Settings → RESTART GUIDE. Good luck!\"\n      },\n      \"home_stats_box\": {\n        \"title\": \"Stats box at the bottom 📊\",\n        \"body\": \"At the bottom of Home there's a panel with GROSS, NET, PROFIT and COSTS of the day, updated live as you type. It's very important to check each day at a glance. Tap PROFIT to see the breakdown.\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"suppliers\": {\n    \"cash\": \"CONTANTI\",\n    \"invoice\": \"FATTURA\",\n    \"mixed\": \"MISTO\",\n    \"invoiceNumber\": \"N° FATTURA\",\n    \"dueDate\": \"DA PAGARE IL\",\n    \"chooseDate\": \"Scegli Data\",\n    \"invoiceAmount\": \"IMPORTO FATTURA €\",\n    \"cashAmount\": \"IMPORTO CONTANTI €\",\n    \"splitCost\": \"RIPARTIZIONE COSTO\",\n    \"splitToday\": \"OGGI\",\n    \"split7Days\": \"7 GIORNI\",\n    \"splitCustom\": \"PERSONALIZZA\",\n    \"datesSelected\": \"Selezionate {{count}} date\",\n    \"splitNote\": \"Il costo della fattura di {{name}} (€{{amount}}) verrà ripartito sui mercati effettivi. Verranno detratti €{{perDay}} per i prossimi {{days}} {{market}}.\",\n    \"market\": \"mercato\",\n    \"markets\": \"mercati\",\n    \"fromDate\": \"Vom\",\n    \"toDate\": \"Bis zum\"\n  },\n  \"fiere\": {\n    \"infoFair\": \"INFO FIERA\",\n    \"fairName\": \"Nome fiera *\",\n    \"locationCity\": \"Luogo / Città\",\n    \"eventDate\": \"Data evento\",\n    \"from\": \"Dalle\",\n    \"to\": \"Alle\",\n    \"kmRt\": \"Km A/R\",\n    \"pitch\": \"Plat. €\",\n    \"notes\": \"Note (contatto, referente, ecc.)\",\n    \"history4y\": \"STORICO ULTIMI 4 ANNI\",\n    \"noHistory\": \"Nessun dato storico disponibile\",\n    \"fairsThisMonth\": \"FIERE DI QUESTO MESE\",\n    \"allFairs\": \"TUTTE LE FIERE\",\n    \"addFair\": \"Aggiungi Fiera\",\n    \"noFairsMonth\": \"Nessuna fiera registrata per questo mese\",\n    \"save\": \"SALVA\",\n    \"tapDateToAdd\": \"Tocca una data per aggiungere/modificare una fiera\",\n    \"fair\": \"FIERA\",\n    \"festival\": \"SAGRA\",\n    \"event\": \"EVENTO\"\n  },\n  \"buongiorno\": {\n    \"quickSummary\": \"RIEPILOGO RAPIDO\",\n    \"payments\": \"Pagam.: \",\n    \"appointments\": \"Appunt.: \",\n    \"orders\": \"Ordini: \",\n    \"fairs\": \"Fiere: \",\n    \"weather\": \"Meteo: \",\n    \"bestFuel\": \"Miglior rifornim.: \",\n    \"open\": \"(apri)\"\n  }\n};\n});","lineCount":601,"map":[[601,3]],"functionMap":null},"type":"js/module"}]}